# StartupScope AI — 20-Feature Upgrade Implementation Plan

## Goal

Transform StartupScope AI from a single-model validation tool into a **multi-model, RAG-grounded, self-healing intelligence platform** with deep data pipelines (pricing, funding, sentiment, patents, jobs, traffic), temporal tracking, and infrastructure hardening.

## Execution Strategy

The user's directive is **quality over quantity**. We will implement features in strict dependency order across multiple coding sessions:

- **Session 1 (This session):** Tier 1 Features 1–4 + Tier 2 Features 5–7
- **Session 2:** Tier 2 Features 8–10 + Tier 3 Features 11–12
- **Session 3:** Tier 3 Features 13–16
- **Session 4:** Tier 4 Features 17–20

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **The Reddit Rule:** Feature 7 (Social Sentiment) will have full code written but the Reddit API call will be **commented out** with a fallback to `"Neutral"` score. `REDDIT_CLIENT_ID` and `REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET` will be added to `.env` requirements as placeholders.

