### Feature 3: Structured Output + Self-Heal (Foundation — Build FIRST)

#### [NEW] [schemas/ai_reports.py](file:///Users/likhith./Startup_Scope_AI/backend/app/schemas/ai_reports.py)

The **single source of truth** for all AI output schemas. Both Gemini and Groq must conform to these exact Pydantic v2 models. The self-heal loop injects the schema + the broken output back into the prompt on failure.

- `ConsensusReport` — merged multi-model output
- `PricingTier`, `CompetitorPricing` — Feature 5
- `FundingRound`, `CompetitorFunding` — Feature 6
- `SentimentResult` — Feature 7
- `TemporalDiff` — Feature 4

#### [MODIFY] [ai_pipeline.py](file:///Users/likhith./Startup_Scope_AI/backend/app/services/ai_pipeline.py)

- Wrap `generate_ai_report()` with `@tenacity.retry` (max 3 attempts)
- On `ValidationError`, inject the broken JSON + the Pydantic schema into a correction prompt
- Add `generate_groq_report()` — same structured output schema, using Groq SDK
- Add `embed_chunks()` — batch embedding via Gemini text-embedding-004
- Add `cosine_search_chunks()` — query pgvector via Supabase RPC

