### Feature 2: RAG Grounding Layer

#### [NEW] [services/rag.py](file:///Users/likhith./Startup_Scope_AI/backend/app/services/rag.py)

- `chunk_text(text, chunk_size=500) -> List[str]` — splits Firecrawl output into ~500-token chunks
- `embed_and_store_chunks(validation_id, chunks, source_urls) -> None` — embeds each chunk via Gemini text-embedding-004, inserts into `rag_chunks` table
- `retrieve_context(query_text, validation_id, top_k=10) -> str` — embeds the query, runs cosine similarity search against `rag_chunks`, returns concatenated top-K chunks as grounding context

#### [MODIFY] [celery_tasks.py](file:///Users/likhith./Startup_Scope_AI/backend/app/worker/celery_tasks.py)

- After `firecrawl_scrape()`, call `chunk_text()` + `embed_and_store_chunks()`
- Before `generate_ai_report()`, call `retrieve_context()` to get RAG-grounded context
- Inject grounded context into both Gemini and Groq prompts

