### Celery Task Orchestration (Wiring It All Together)

#### [MODIFY] [celery_tasks.py](file:///Users/likhith./Startup_Scope_AI/backend/app/worker/celery_tasks.py)

The main `process_validation` task will be refactored into this pipeline:

```
1. Dedup + Lock (unchanged)
2. Firecrawl scrape competitors
3. RAG: chunk + embed + store competitor data
4. RAG: retrieve grounded context for the idea
5. Parallel AI: Gemini report + Groq report (ThreadPoolExecutor)
6. Self-heal: retry on malformed output (tenacity)
7. Consensus merge
8. Parallel data pipelines: pricing + funding + sentiment (ThreadPoolExecutor)
9. Write-through: all results to Supabase
10. Cache in Redis
11. Publish WebSocket event (with all enrichment data)
```

